Folder.GetFiles Folder: $'''C:\Invoices''' Filter: $'''*.xlsx''' Files=> Files
LOOP FOREACH CurrentItem IN Files
    Excel.LaunchExcel Path: CurrentItem Visible: False Instance=> ExcelInstance
    Excel.GetFirstFreeRow Instance: ExcelInstance FirstFreeRow=> FirstFreeRow
    DateTime.GetCurrentDateTime CurrentDateTime=> CurrentDateTime
    Excel.WriteToExcel Instance: ExcelInstance Value: $'''Processed %CurrentDateTime%''' Column: $'''A''' Row: FirstFreeRow
    Excel.CloseExcel Instance: ExcelInstance Save: True
END
Display.ShowMessage Message: $'''Stamped %Files.Count% invoices''' Title: $'''Invoice roll-up'''
